Documented in archive records, USA-NY''s work reflects a sustained commitment to raising awareness about involuntary non-therapeutic genital modifications, helping to foster regional support for intact children and advancing the broader goals of the bodily autonomy movement.', '', '', 'champion', 'An American intactivist organizer and advocate representing New York within national genital autonomy networks.', 1, '');
